  "raw": " decided that the ultimate form of boredom, is making the rest of your life meaningless by simply not existing.\nWow! So what happens when you die? You come back to life.  Sounds legit.\nYes, and then you fall asleep, and the next day you wake up and repeat.  Basically, you die, you wake up. Unless of course, you die and the next day you wake up and repeat, because then you still don't die.\nThat’s weird. I guess you can’t die.",
